{"_notes":["AC/DC (v1.70, 2012, Stern).","Stern SAM platform. ARM AT91 CPU, NVRAM at CPU 0x02100000.","Scores are 4-byte little-endian integers.","Stride between entries is 0x24 bytes.","Verified against NVRAM data with real scores.","The champion record starts at the name, not the score: 24 bytes of name and 0xFF fill, the","score at +24, then a 16-bit checksum (0xFFFF minus the sum of the preceding bytes) and two","slack bytes. That framing is what the checksum proves -- it validates on all five records when","they are taken to start at the name and on none when taken to start at the score -- and it","fixes a pairing error: each name was previously read from the following record, so the Grand","Champion's score was reported against the first-place player's initials. With the records","framed correctly this game's factory defaults read JDB/75,000,000, LFS/55,000,000 and so on,","the same set the rest of the SAM family ships (SSR/75,000,000 here).","bytes have read zero in every image captured, so the width is taken from the record's","The record is 36 bytes with the checksum at +32, so four bytes sit between the 4-byte score at","+24 and the checksum. They read zero in every image captured (163 records across five games)","and their purpose is not established: they are consistent with the upper half of a 64-bit score,","but this game's champion-threshold table at 0x021024F8 stores its thresholds as 4-byte values","with a complement check byte, which is what a 32-bit score would be compared against. The score","is therefore declared as 4 bytes until a value above 2^32 is observed or the ROM is disassembled.","2026-11: current_player/current_ball 0x0002EEC0/+1 and the status byte 0x0002EEF2 (player +","0x32; 01 attract, 43 ball served, 14 play, 16 tilted) added from a headless game.","2026-11: Master Volume and the A.1 (64) and A.2 (118) adjustments and the Encore Champion record","added from the ROM image (README, 'Adjustments from the ROM').","Champion 0x021039D8 is the ROM's LIVE SONG JACKPOT CHAMPION (was labelled Encore Champion) and","0x021039FC its ENCORE: acd_170h's order and factory values (30M, 150M). Neither shows in","attract.","Confirmed on a cabinet 2026-11-13 (ALP4K; two players, tilt on P1 ball 1): 1,281,340 /","2,278,840, the records and the status byte matched the DMD."],"_fileformat":0.9,"_metadata":{"version":10,"copyright":["Copyright (C) 2026 by Tom Collins <tom@scorbit.io>"],"license":"Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0","platform":"stern-sam.6e326d93","roms":["acd_170"],"validation":{"checksum":[{"label":"High Score #{#}","start":"0x0210372C","repeat":{"count":5,"step":36},"length":34,"bits":16,"complement":true},{"label":"Mode Champ #{#}","start":"0x021037E0","repeat":{"count":16,"step":36},"length":34,"bits":16,"complement":true},{"_notes":"184 adjustments: 4-byte LE value, 1-byte checksum, 3 bytes 0xFF padding","label":"Adjustment {#} (checksum)","start":"0x02102008","length":5,"complement":true,"repeat":{"count":184,"step":8}},{"label":"Master Volume","start":"0x02110248","end":"0x02110249","complement":true}]},"values":{"no_yes":["NO","YES"],"credit_ticket_token":["CREDIT","TICKET","TOKEN"]}},"high_scores":[{"label":"Grand Champion","short_label":"GC","initials":{"start":"0x210372C","encoding":"ch","null":"terminate","length":11},"score":{"start":"0x02103744","encoding":"int","length":8}},{"label":"First Place","short_label":"#1","initials":{"start":"0x2103750","encoding":"ch","null":"terminate","length":11},"score":{"start":"0x02103768","encoding":"int","length":8}},{"label":"Second Place","short_label":"#2","initials":{"start":"0x2103774","encoding":"ch","null":"terminate","length":11},"score":{"start":"0x0210378C","encoding":"int","length":8}},{"label":"Third Place","short_label":"#3","initials":{"start":"0x2103798","encoding":"ch","null":"terminate","length":11},"score":{"start":"0x021037B0","encoding":"int","length":8}},{"label":"Fourth Place","short_label":"#4","initials":{"st